										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Pocket air filter are common air purification equipment that uses bag-shaped filter material to make filter bags to capture particles and pollutants in the air. This type of air filter is typically used in industrial and commercial settings, but can also be used in home air purification systems.</p>
<h3>Work Principle of Pocket Air Filter</h3>
<p>The working principle of the pocket air filter is that when the air flows through the filter bag, the particles are captured by the filter material in the filter bag. These filter media can be made of synthetic fiber, fiberglass or other special materials. Air bag filters usually have a larger filtration area, so they can hold more particles and extend the filter replacement cycle.</p>
<p><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="alignnone  wp-image-4449" src="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Work-Principle-of-Pocket-Air-Filter-detail1-300x166.jpg" alt="" width="792" height="438" srcset="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Work-Principle-of-Pocket-Air-Filter-detail1-300x166.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Work-Principle-of-Pocket-Air-Filter-detail1-1024x567.jpg 1024w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Work-Principle-of-Pocket-Air-Filter-detail1-768x426.jpg 768w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Work-Principle-of-Pocket-Air-Filter-detail1-600x333.jpg 600w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Work-Principle-of-Pocket-Air-Filter-detail1.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 792px) 100vw, 792px" /></p>
